⛔ ONE COMMIT FOLLOWS THIS RUN — the one that appends this section, the matching
SUMMARY row and two comment-only lines in run.mjs. It is recorded here rather
than chased with a fifth run, because chasing it never terminates: every run
needs a commit and every commit invalidates the run. What makes that honest is a
diff, not an argument — `git diff --name-only df45db38 <that commit>` touches
only `.planning/**` and comment lines in `scripts/mutation-runner/run.mjs`, and
`git diff df45db38 <that commit> -- supabase/ scripts/pg-lane/` is EMPTY. No
constant, no gate file, no migration and no fixture moved, so the runner's inputs
are byte-identical to the tree measured above.
